{
  "name": "Send new IIMJobs postings to Google Sheets and Slack with Apify",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Send new IIMJobs postings to Google Sheets and Slack\n\n**Who it's for:** recruiters, hiring-market analysts and job seekers tracking MBA, finance, consulting and management roles in India.\n\n**What it does:** every morning it asks the Apify actor [IIMJobs Jobs Scraper](https://apify.com/data_daemon/iimjobs-jobs-scraper) for postings that this feed has **not delivered before**, upserts them into a Google Sheet (matched on `id`) and posts a short Slack summary.\n\n**Setup (5 minutes)**\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your API token (Apify Console → Settings → API & Integrations).\n2. In **Get new IIMJobs postings**, create a *Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN`.\n3. In **Upsert jobs into Google Sheets**, connect Google and paste your sheet URL. Add a `Jobs` tab with the header row `id, title, company, locations, experience, salaryLpa, skills, applicants, postedAt, url`.\n4. In **Slack summary**, connect Slack and pick a channel.\n5. Edit `queries` in the request body, then activate the workflow.\n\n**Requirements:** Apify account (pay per result; the price is on the actor page), Google Sheets, Slack.\n\n**Customize:** change `queries`, add `locations` (e.g. `[\"Mumbai\"]`), set `includeDescription: true` for full job descriptions, or point the URL at `data_daemon~hirist-jobs-scraper` for tech jobs (same output fields).",
        "height": 720,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "fb89b0c7-7859-433a-bf52-d33f3e09c00f",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -560,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 1. Fetch only new jobs\nRuns at 08:00. `onlyNewSinceLastRun` + `stateName` make Apify remember which jobs this feed already sent, so nothing is duplicated. `maxTotalChargeUsd` in the URL caps the cost of a single run.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "93a67617-8704-4f81-9e89-1561933dcfc2",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 2. Store and notify\nRows are upserted on `id`. Hidden salaries show as `hidden`; most IIMJobs recruiters hide pay. Slack gets the count and the first five jobs.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "2edd670a-916c-4c36-a94f-df445832859e",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        500,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 8
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "trigger-1",
      "name": "Every day 08:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/data_daemon~iimjobs-jobs-scraper/run-sync-get-dataset-items?clean=1&maxTotalChargeUsd=0.5",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"queries\": [\n    \"product manager\",\n    \"investment banking\"\n  ],\n  \"locations\": [],\n  \"onlyNewSinceLastRun\": true,\n  \"stateName\": \"n8n-iimjobs-daily\",\n  \"includeDescription\": false,\n  \"maxJobsPerQuery\": 50,\n  \"maxJobs\": 100\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 300000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "json"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "http-1",
      "name": "Get new IIMJobs postings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_SHEET_ID/edit"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Jobs"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "defineBelow",
          "value": {
            "id": "={{ $json.id }}",
            "title": "={{ $json.title }}",
            "company": "={{ $json.company?.name ?? '(confidential)' }}",
            "locations": "={{ ($json.locations ?? []).join(', ') }}",
            "experience": "={{ $json.experienceMinYears }}-{{ $json.experienceMaxYears }} yrs",
            "salaryLpa": "={{ $json.salaryHidden ? 'hidden' : $json.salaryMinLpa + '-' + $json.salaryMaxLpa }}",
            "skills": "={{ ($json.skills ?? []).join(', ') }}",
            "applicants": "={{ $json.applicants }}",
            "postedAt": "={{ $json.postedAt }}",
            "url": "={{ $json.url }}"
          },
          "matchingColumns": [
            "id"
          ],
          "schema": [
            {
              "id": "id",
              "displayName": "id",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": true,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "title",
              "displayName": "title",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "company",
              "displayName": "company",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "locations",
              "displayName": "locations",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "experience",
              "displayName": "experience",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "salaryLpa",
              "displayName": "salaryLpa",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "skills",
              "displayName": "skills",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "applicants",
              "displayName": "applicants",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "postedAt",
              "displayName": "postedAt",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            },
            {
              "id": "url",
              "displayName": "url",
              "type": "string",
              "display": true,
              "required": false,
              "defaultMatch": false,
              "canBeUsedToMatch": true,
              "removed": false
            }
          ],
          "attemptToConvertTypes": false,
          "convertFieldsToString": true
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "sheets-1",
      "name": "Upsert jobs into Google Sheets",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        560,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "#jobs"
        },
        "text": "={{ $('Get new IIMJobs postings').all().length }} new IIMJobs postings were added to the sheet.\nTop 5:\n{{ $('Get new IIMJobs postings').all().slice(0, 5).map(i => '• ' + i.json.title + ' — ' + (i.json.company?.name ?? 'confidential') + ' — ' + i.json.url).join('\\n') }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "slack-1",
      "name": "Slack summary",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        40
      ],
      "executeOnce": true
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every day 08:00": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Get new IIMJobs postings",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Get new IIMJobs postings": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Upsert jobs into Google Sheets",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Upsert jobs into Google Sheets": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Slack summary",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {}
}